	measure 'Revenue at Risk' = ```
			SUMX(factSales, 
			                        factSales[revenue_eur]*RELATED(dimCustomer[base_churn_probability]))
			```
		formatString: #,0\ "€";-#,0\ "€";#,0\ "€"
