	measure 'True Negatives' = ```
			
			  VAR LabeledRows = [Evaluation Records]
			  VAR TP = [True Positives]
			  VAR FP = [False Positives]
			  VAR FN_ = [False Negatives]
			  RETURN
			      IF (
			          ISBLANK ( LabeledRows ),
			          BLANK (),
			          LabeledRows - TP - FP - FN_
			      )
			
			```
